# The local production build's output directory (scripts/start-local-prod.mjs).
# Its absence here is why `npm run format:check` reported 678 unformatted files
# and why the CI gate was left disabled: `.next-prod` vendors dependencies with
# their own sources, so once anybody had run a production build the check was
# measuring third-party packages.
